```
id: SPL-005
name: Firewall deny spike by source
description: A source generates far more denied connections than its own recent baseline.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Discovery
mitre_technique: T1046 Network Service Discovery
severity: Low
data_source: index=firewall
false_positives: Misconfigured hosts, vulnerability scans, application deployments.
tuning: Exclude scanner ranges; adjust the sigma multiplier and minimum count.
test_method: Run a port scan from a lab host against a blocked range.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=firewall action IN ("blocked","denied","deny","drop") earliest=-4h
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count BY _time, src
| eventstats avg(count) AS avg_count stdev(count) AS sd_count BY src
| where count>=100 AND count>(avg_count+3*sd_count)
| sort - count
